# M-package-manager step 5b (the coordinator's ruling of 2026-11-08): the
# entry's `git` names a folder of the program's own, and git, asked from where
# it may not look at the repository above (the case's `environment`), places
# the program in none, so `heroes fetch` reads no `file://` source for it. The
# build tells the verb's refusal, git's words beside it, where it said *not
# placed: `heroes fetch` places it*.
use <yaml>/load  #~ source_refused

function main()
    print(load.size())
